+  `lyx tender status` lists the live entries, the network operations in flight and the parent locks held, every live session in the hub with its state, cause and whether an entry covers it, the lyx processes running a replaced binary, the processes registered to runs with their orphans, and each pair's owner machine with the run-held entries owned by another machine; it changes nothing, and any caller may run it.
